<section class="band dusk on-dark" id="excerpt">
  <div class="wrap two-col signup">
    <div>
      <h2>Read Act I for free.</h2>
      <p>Leave your email and Lou will send you the first act of <em>Traddyland</em> as a PDF, along with a short letter every few weeks about the book, the podcast, and the parts of this story still unfolding.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      {%- if site.buttondown %}
      <form action="https://buttondown.com/api/emails/embed-subscribe/{{ site.buttondown }}" method="POST" target="_blank">
        <input type="hidden" name="tag" value="act-one">
        <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email address" required aria-label="Email address">
      {%- else %}
      <form action="https://formsubmit.co/{{ site.email }}" method="POST">
        <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Act I request from traddyland.com">
        <input type="hidden" name="_next" value="{{ site.url }}/act-one/">
        <input type="hidden" name="_autoresponse" value="Thank you for wanting to read Traddyland. Here is the first act, the prologue through chapter nine, as a PDF you can read on any device: {{ site.url }}/files/traddyland-act-one.pdf  It picks up on a winter night in 1983, when I was thirteen and my family knelt for the Rosary in a drafty house on Oneida Lake, and it ends about where my life stopped making sense to the people who loved me. If it stays with you, the whole book is available on Amazon in paperback and for Kindle, and I would be grateful if you kept going: {{ site.amazon }}  A good number of readers have written to say the book sounded like their own family, and some of those conversations are now happening in the open on the Traddyland forum. You are welcome there, whether you agree with me or not: {{ site.url }}/forum/  Every few weeks I send a short letter about the book, the podcast, and the parts of this story that are still unfolding. Write back anytime. I read everything.  Lou Massett">
        <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email address" required aria-label="Email address">
      {%- endif %}
        <button class="btn" type="submit">Send me Act I</button>
      </form>
      <p class="fine">No spam. Unsubscribe any time.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
